type: software
title: "SafeFlipLab"
abstract: "Budgeted counterfactual safety-reversal testing for simplified autonomous-driving simulations: four-condition paired quartets (front gap / ego speed interventions) around legal anchors, WideExplore vs VerifyFirst under fixed episode budgets, and independent held-out audits."
authors:
